@node Dependencies
@section Dependencies

@itemize
@item GLib 2.0 / GObject / GIO / GModule
@item libxml2
@item json-glib
@item libsoup 3.x, or libsoup 2.4 @math{\ge} 2.58
@item Autotools (@command{autoconf}, @command{automake}, @command{libtool})
@item Texinfo (@command{makeinfo}) to build this manual
@end itemize

There is no dependency on @command{starter-core}.

@node Build Steps
@section Build Steps

@example
$ ./autogen.sh
$ ./configure
$ make
$ sudo make install
@end example

The shared library installs as @code{libstarter-configurable-adapter},
with pkg-config module @code{starter-configurable-adapter}. The in-tree
@code{dummy} plugin installs under

@example
$(libdir)/starter/configurable-adapter/plugins
@end example

@example
$ make doc          # PDF manual (requires TeX)
$ make -C doc info  # Info manual
@end example

@node Running the Adapter
@chapter Running the Adapter

@menu
* Command Line::
